**Read:** [Industrial Chemical Technology II — Nduka, NOUN](../sources/Industrial-Chemical-Technology-II-NOUN.lingua#r_7RXE2GF1DW7QH9GHTCGT0P09SR), the complete synthesis-gas, reforming, gasification and oxo-process units; [Chemical Technology I — Indra Deo Mall, NPTEL](../sources/Chemical-Technology-I-Mall.lingua#r_2QDGEANAX8QTGRS531GFVF4H74), the entire fuel/industrial-gas and coal-chemical sequence where available; [Haber–Bosch ammonia in an energy landscape — Smith, Hill and Torrente-Murciano](../sources/Haber-Bosch-Ammonia-Smith-Hill-Torrente.lingua#r_6CX46VQ3D3W0W059Y55D44MMAQ), the full relevant feed-generation and purification account.

Synthesis gas denotes a useful reacting gas mixture, commonly involving hydrogen and carbon monoxide, with composition suited to a downstream transformation. Reforming, gasification and partial oxidation differ in feed, oxygen/steam supply, thermal duties, species distribution and impurities. The name alone does not define a usable product.

For idealized methane steam reforming, CH₄+H₂O⇌CO+3H₂. Combining complete water-gas shift gives CH₄+2H₂O→CO₂+4H₂. These balanced relations establish atom accounts; actual equilibrium, rates, side reactions, heat supply and gas cleanup determine what a real unit produces.

Track sulfur, particulates, condensable compounds and other contaminants through feed preparation, hot-gas processing, cooling and purification. A change from fossil to biological feed can alter variability and cleanup needs even when the target gas ratio is similar. Oxygen and steam supplies connect the route with other industries.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete reforming or gasification route from actual feed characterization to a specified synthesis feed. Independently close carbon/hydrogen/oxygen, utility and impurity accounts, then compare a second route on the same usable output. Identify which thermodynamic, kinetic or measured operating evidence most limits the comparison.

**Continue:** [Adjust a synthesis feed while preserving reaction, separation and impurity accounts](Water-gas-shift-separation-and-synthesis-feed-adjustment.lingua#r_2T84DMWN3FA6P8Q4GJNAEM70Y1).

